'' --diagnostics-file: an intermediate the compiler cannot write is TKO0112, exit 5.
''
'' The output's directory does not exist, so the '.ll' beside it cannot be created. Needs
'' clang to be FOUND (FindTools runs first), not to run.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -o build/.diagfile-no-such-dir/x.exe --diagnostics-file build/.diagfile-irwrite.tsv tests/source/plain.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 5
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0112: cannot write intermediate file
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.diagfile-irwrite.tsv :: \nerror\tTKO0112\t\t0\t0\t0\t0\tcannot write intermediate file '
'' EXPECT-FILE-HAS: build/.diagfile-irwrite.tsv :: \nend\t1\t0\t5\n
